comiendo.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<div class=\"student-info\">\n<div class=\"student-avatar\">A</div>\n<div class=\"student-details\">\n<h4 class=\"student-name\">Andres Fernández</h4>\n<p class=\"course-name\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\">\n<span class=\"star-rating\">★★★★★</span>\n<p class=\"review-date\">diciembre 2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-content\">\n<p class=\"review-text\">Buenísimo el curso y el profesor responde dudas a tiempo. Slds</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<div class=\"student-info\">\n<div class=\"student-avatar\">I</div>\n<div class=\"student-details\">\n<h4 class=\"student-name\">Ignacio Vizcaíno</h4>\n<p class=\"course-name\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\">\n<span class=\"star-rating\">★★★★★</span>\n<p class=\"review-date\">octubre 2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-content\">\n<p class=\"review-text\">Interesante y útil, totalmente recomendable</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
